Helm charts for Puppet CD4PE and SCM

These charts are unofficial and are not supported by Puppet or Perforce.

Parts of this repository are derived from two Puppet modules, both published
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  puppetlabs-cd4peadm   5.19.1
  puppetlabs-complyadm  3.10.0

The derived files are the configuration under charts/cd4pe/files and
charts/scm/files, and the environment and container settings in the chart
templates. Each derived configuration file that can carry a comment says which
module template it came from and what was changed. charts/scm/files/Puppet-realm.json.tmpl
is JSON and cannot: it is templates/identity/puppet-realm.json.epp from
puppetlabs-complyadm with its EPP parameters replaced by @@NAME@@ placeholders.

The charts pull the product container images from Puppet's registry at install
time. No product image or binary is included in this repository.
